{"ordinal":15209,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998347","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Death_08478ed","source":"Theorist: Истина останется…","target":"Theorist: Adevărul va rămâne…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15210,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998346","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Death_05715d3","source":"Theorist: Даже если меня не будет.","target":"Theorist: Chiar dacă eu nu voi mai fi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15211,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998345","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_DontShoot_07d384e","source":"Theorist: Вы знаете, что нас программируют через звук? Частоты, инфразвук, ритмы – всё это изменяет сознание. Но я научился слушать сквозь шум.","target":"Theorist: Știți că suntem programați prin sunete? Frecvențele, infrasunetele, ritmurile: toate ne schimbă conștiința. Dar eu am învățat să ascult dincolo de zgomot.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15212,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998344","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_DontShoot_0638a89","source":"Theorist: Фотографии – это якоря. Они держат нас в реальности, доказывают, что мы были, что существовали. Именно поэтому они так опасны.","target":"Theorist: Fotografiile sunt ancore. Ne țin în realitate, dovedesc că am fost aici, că am existat. Tocmai de aceea sunt atât de periculoase.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15213,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998343","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_DontShoot_0c1cf22","source":"Theorist: Они отвлекают, маскируют правду. Всё должно пахнуть реальностью.","target":"Theorist: Distrag atenția și ascund adevărul. Totul trebuie să miroasă a realitate.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15214,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998342","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_DontShoot_0d4a80e","source":"Theorist: Люди боятся запахов, но они естественны. Знаете, что искусственные ароматы – это инструмент манипуляции?","target":"Theorist: Oamenii se tem de mirosuri, dar ele sunt firești. Știți că aromele artificiale sunt un mijloc de manipulare?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15215,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998341","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_DontShoot_01c9cab","source":"Theorist: Когда смотришь слишком долго, истина начинает смотреть в ответ. Видите её в моих глазах?","target":"Theorist: Când privești prea mult, adevărul începe să privească înapoi. Îl vedeți în ochii mei?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15216,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998340","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_DontShoot_04bf8b3","source":"Theorist: Когда-то мне сказали: «Если ты держишь в руках истину, готовься к тому, что её у тебя отнимут». Но я держусь. До последнего.","target":"Theorist: Cândva mi s-a spus: „Dacă ții adevărul în mâini, pregătește-te să ți-l smulgă cineva.” Dar eu nu renunț. Până la capăt.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15217,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998339","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_DontShoot_055e398","source":"Theorist: Следы работы Гостей.","target":"Theorist: Urmele lucrării Musafirilor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15218,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998338","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_DontShoot_0f5e851","source":"Theorist: Если рассмотреть трещины под микроскопом, можно заметить следы…","target":"Theorist: Dacă examinați crăpăturile la microscop, veți vedea urme…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15219,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998337","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_DontShoot_026142e","source":"Theorist: Вы знаете, что в зубных пломбах могут быть микроантенны? В некоторых странах это подтверждено.","target":"Theorist: Știți că plombele dentare pot conține microantene? În unele țări s-a confirmat asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15220,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452169998336","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_Gun_041b49d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15221,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804042","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_Gun_011c85b","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15222,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804041","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_Gun_04f6d0e","source":"Theorist: Вы хотите, чтобы я замолчал? Вам кажется, что так будет проще? Но тишина – это тоже инструмент контроля.","target":"Theorist: Vreți să tac? Credeți că așa va fi mai simplu? Dar și tăcerea e un mijloc de control.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15223,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804040","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_Gun_0d7a8f0","source":"Theorist: Цельтесь в Гостей, у них будет другая вибрация!","target":"Theorist: Țintiți spre Musafiri, ei au altă vibrație!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15224,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804039","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_Gun_04e1e9b","source":"Theorist: Да, по этому признаку ушная раковина срезонирует с выстрелом, но…","target":"Theorist: Da, după semnul ăsta pavilionul urechii va rezona cu împușcătura, dar…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15225,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804038","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_Gun_0472488","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15226,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804037","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_Gun_0bd256c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15227,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804036","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_Gun_03836db","source":"Theorist: Вы хотите стереть эту фотографию? Или человека на ней? Подумайте, кто вас к этому толкает.","target":"Theorist: Vreți să ștergeți fotografia asta? Sau pe omul din ea? Gândiți-vă cine vă împinge să faceți asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15228,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804035","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_Gun_044a642","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15229,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804034","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_Gun_0ff9aa9","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15230,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804033","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_Gun_0f7b9b0","source":"Theorist: Вы хотите, чтобы я поднял руки? Разве не странно, что это жест покорности закреплён во всех культурах? Не задумывались, кто это навязал?","target":"Theorist: Vreți să ridic mâinile? Nu vi se pare ciudat că gestul ăsta de supunere există în toate culturile? Nu v-ați întrebat cine l-a impus?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15231,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452165804032","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_Gun_05f4b19","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15232,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609739","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_Gun_0f026e8","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15233,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609738","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_Gun_026dab8","source":"Theorist: Вы понимаете, что оружие – это тоже инструмент контроля?","target":"Theorist: Înțelegeți că și arma e un mijloc de control?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15234,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609737","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_Gun_0fec6dc","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15235,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609736","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_Gun_0119949","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15236,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609735","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_Gun_0a282ec","source":"Theorist: Вы боитесь тех, кто ищет правду? Тогда вы боитесь не меня, а себя.","target":"Theorist: Vă temeți de cei care caută adevărul? Atunci nu de mine vă temeți, ci de dumneavoastră înșivă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15237,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609734","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_Gun_0e33d1a","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15238,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609733","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_Gun_0559f9f","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15239,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609732","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_Gun_070ed5c","source":"Theorist: Стреляйте, но знайте: вам в рот тоже могут что-то подложить. Пища давно уже не просто пища…","target":"Theorist: Trageți, dar să știți că și dumneavoastră vă poate pune cineva ceva în gură. Hrana nu mai e de mult doar hrană…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-384.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15240,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609731","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_0b63441","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15241,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609730","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_0ab2b4c","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15242,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609729","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_06117e2","source":"Theorist: Вы ищете следы? Не беспокойтесь, я защищён.","target":"Theorist: Căutați urme? Nu vă îngrijorați, eu sunt protejat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15243,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452161609728","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_070c8fc","source":"Theorist: Вы услышали, возможно, единственный правдивый выпуск новостей?","target":"Theorist: Poate tocmai ați auzit singurul buletin de știri adevărat?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15244,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415434","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_0e23cb0","source":"Theorist: ...","target":"Theorist: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15245,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415433","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Ears_0437fcd","source":"Theorist: Уши? Ах, понимаю.","target":"Theorist: Urechile? Ah, înțeleg.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15246,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415432","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_0af46c3","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15247,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415431","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_05a2e9d","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15248,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415430","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_00ea7ee","source":"Theorist: Они не принадлежат вам. Их могут изменить, удалить. А этот… этот момент – неподвластен их влиянию.","target":"Theorist: Nu vă aparțin. Pot fi modificate, șterse. Dar clipa asta… clipa asta scapă influenței lor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15249,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415429","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_0b2a89d","source":"Theorist: ...","target":"Theorist: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15250,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415428","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Photo_044905e","source":"Theorist: Фото?","target":"Theorist: O fotografie?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15251,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415427","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_0f02359","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15252,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415426","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_0cfdbae","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15253,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415425","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_0342bb2","source":"Theorist: Те, кто избавляются от них, даже не догадываются, что подвергают себя контролю через потоотделение.","target":"Theorist: Cei care scapă de el nici nu bănuiesc că astfel se expun controlului prin transpirație.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15254,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452157415424","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_04623e6","source":"Theorist: Видите волосы? Естественная защита. Они снижают испарение, сохраняют соль.","target":"Theorist: Vedeți părul? E o protecție firească. Reduce evaporarea, păstrează sarea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15255,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221130","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_00594ee","source":"Theorist: ...","target":"Theorist: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15256,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221129","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Armpit_0359fd6","source":"Theorist: Подмышки, говорите?.. Это редкость.","target":"Theorist: Axilele, spuneți?.. E neobișnuit.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15257,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221128","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_099f179","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15258,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221127","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_04a845a","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15259,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221126","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_0e984c9","source":"Theorist: Что я вижу мир таким, какой он есть, без их фильтров, без их тумана. А вы?","target":"Theorist: Că văd lumea așa cum este, fără filtrele lor, fără ceața lor. Dar dumneavoastră?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15260,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221125","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_02f44a2","source":"Theorist: А когда перед тобой множество фактов, приходится глазами постоянно всё фиксировать. Пока реальность не поменяли.","target":"Theorist: Iar când ai în față atâtea fapte, trebuie să înregistrezi totul mereu cu ochii. Până nu schimbă ei realitatea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15261,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221124","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_0ca0ccd","source":"Theorist: Голубой цвет – знаете, что это значит? Это значит, что меня не успели изменить.","target":"Theorist: Albastru: știți ce înseamnă? Înseamnă că n-au apucat să mă schimbe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15262,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221123","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_0c282cd","source":"Theorist: ...","target":"Theorist: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15263,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221122","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Eyes_0da10f7","source":"Theorist: Ага, глаза, да, конечно.","target":"Theorist: Aha, ochii, da, desigur.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15264,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221121","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_0eabbe6","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15265,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452153221120","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_009ae1d","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15266,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452149026827","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_0f073b2","source":"Theorist: Видите чернила? Они под ногтями, на коже, въелись в поры. Это следы знаний, за которые мне пришлось заплатить.","target":"Theorist: Vedeți cerneala? E sub unghii, pe piele, a intrat în pori. Sunt urmele cunoașterii pentru care am plătit un preț.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15267,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452149026826","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Hands_01df755","source":"Theorist: Видите чернила? Они под ногтями, на коже, въелись в поры. Кожа огрубела, но такова цена за следы знаний.","target":"Theorist: Vedeți cerneala? E sub unghii, pe piele, a intrat în pori. Pielea s-a înăsprit, dar acesta e prețul urmelor cunoașterii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
