{"ordinal":15271,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452149026822","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_0cbf5e8","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":15272,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452149026821","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Theorist_Teeth_02e20e6","source":"Theorist: Трещины, кровь… Да, да, я знаю. Это от карандашей. Но ведь это просто вредная привычка, верно?","target":"Theorist: Crăpăturile, sângele… Da, da, știu. Sunt de la creioane. Dar e doar un obicei prost, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-385.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
